Package: tempcomp-filter
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Christopher Hoover <ch@murgatroid.com>
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), chrony, systemd, mawk | gawk
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/charlieh0tel/chrony-tempcomp
Description: filtered temperature for chronyd's tempcomp
 Reads a temperature sensor and writes it through a first-order lag to
 /run/chrony/tempcomp-filter, for a chrony.conf line that names that file.
 Set SENSOR and OFF_VALUE in /etc/default/tempcomp-filter, or a host's
 package in /etc/tempcomp-filter.d, to start it.
